le(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达非上市持股价值飙升至65.5亿美元，前九个月股权投资达58亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达最新披露数据显示，其对非上市初创公司的持股价值已从今年1月的22亿美元激增至65.5亿美元。本财年前九个月，英伟达股权投资总额达58亿美元，远超上一财年同期的5亿美元。过去三年，英伟达已投资近350家初创企业，覆盖Anthropic、OpenAI等大模型厂商及Lambda等算力云服务商，并为OpenAI俄亥俄州数据中心项目提供1050亿美元担保。随着黄仁勋离任，市场担忧其投资策略将转向保守。财务高管Kress在财报会议中表示，未来将把扣除战略用途后的多余自由现金流返还给股东，并对未来投资进行严格评估。这一变动引发全球风投界对英伟达资本支持力度可能回落的广泛关注。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元开源Hy4flash系列模型，支持100万token上下文与本地部署</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/441334376a669eb2c881b5382b823ed5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元正式开源Hy4flash系列模型，包含标准版、Hy4flash-FP8量化版及Hy4flash Base训练版，开发者可通过GitHub、Hugging Face、ModelScope及GitCode获取。该模型采用稀疏架构，总参数量224B，含64B Engram参数，推理时每个token仅激活12B，在降低算力成本的同时支持多模态输入与100万token上下文长度。官方同步提供GGUF格式以支持本地部署。目前，腾讯云TokenHub、元宝、企业微信、QQ、ima及Marvis等产品已完成接入。此次开源通过降低权重获取门槛与API调用成本，旨在推动大模型应用落地，并预告更大规模的Hy4模型后续也将加入开源阵营。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软掏出首款语音对语音模型 MAI Realtime 1：能被打断、会打电话干活，价格只有对手三分之一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a115baaae6375aa5e09b715011b69c3c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软掏出首款语音对语音模型 MAI Realtime 1：能被打断、会打电话干活，价格只有对手三分之一AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 18, 202632在昨日（11 月 17 日）的 Ignite 2026 大会上，微软发布首款语音对语音模型 MAI Realtime 1，主打真实企业场景。它能处理打断、快速确认、等对方说完等对话细节，嘈杂环境或多人同时说话时也能听懂请求。任务需要深想时还能调用更强推理引擎，连接企业系统完成预订、客服处理等操作，语气风格可用提示词调教。价格单直接掀了桌子 价格是重头：基础语音对语音使用费每音频分钟仅 0.01 美元，若涉及推理，按每百万输入 token 1 美元、输出 5 美元另行计费。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软在Ignite 2026发布新版Copilot，将Word与Excel集成至AI应用中</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8d49aea16e60347e386fc0335f23c45d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在Ignite 2026大会上，微软宣布Office产品架构重大转型，将Copilot从应用内插件升级为核心交互界面，Word、Excel和PowerPoint功能被深度集成至Copilot应用中。用户通过自然语言指令即可在Copilot界面内直接生成、编辑文档及表格，所有数据存储于OneDrive并遵循企业安全合规标准。此次更新还包括面向销售场景的Copilot for Sales Frontier，支持连接CRM、Zendesk、Notion等第三方业务工具，实现客户信息整理与流程自动化。针对普通职场用户，新增“Today”功能可自动汇总邮件、日历与会议信息，并提供OneNote笔记整理、Pages交互页面生成及Workspaces共享空间等功能。微软旨在将办公软件从单一工具转型为AI智能体协同工作的智能办</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布决策模型Microsoft-Decision-1.1，性能超越GPT-6 Luna</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/fa41029b5b9a724c2d74c34674dcedbf.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软于11月17日正式推出决策模型Microsoft-Decision-1.1，现已登陆Microsoft Foundry、OpenRouter及Vercel平台。该模型专为企业级高频决策场景设计，涵盖路由、分类、内容核验与工作流控制。其核心技术基于中型混合专家模型优化，并配备定制推理引擎。在Artificial Analysis Decision Index v2.1基准测试中，该模型以68分领先GPT-6 Luna、Gemini Decision 1等竞品，推理速度较上代提升超两倍。定价方面，每百万输入token仅需0.042美元，输出免费。该模型支持多模态输入，并能输出校准后的置信度分数，在信息不足时可选择弃权或触发人工介入，以降低业务风险。目前已有超4000名客户使用，包括Epic与Raiffeisen</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
